chapter AFP

session MemSem = Core +
  description \<open>
    MemSem: the thin SMRD memory semantics -- program state
    sigma = (viswrite, memory, phi, RF) and per-action effects. No coherence
    machinery; ordering is delegated to Phi. (Episodic stack layer 2; AFP-capable.)
    (The legacy PSem.thy / OpSem_definite.thy that used to sit here -- the SEFM
    imports -- have been retired; their content is folded into MemSem.thy.)
  \<close>
  options [timeout = 600]
  theories
    MemSem
